# 中文说明：52 原子 Ag/Ti3SiC2 开发构型的探索性冷态松弛筛查。
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data interface_dev_52.data
pair_style pace
pair_coeff * * model.yace Ag C Si Ti
neighbor 2.0 bin
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute maxforce all reduce max v_fmag
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe c_maxforce
min_style fire
min_modify dmax 0.10
minimize 1e-10 0.001 5000 20000
run 0
print "MINIMIZED_FMAX $(c_maxforce:%.16g)"
write_data minimized.data
